{"key":"at-most-k-b27ad34a206599b5","sourceHash":"b27ad34a206599b56d10b021ff3d95751c1777a2898cfedf621579e28867f94e","pattern":"at-most-k","category":"sliding-window","title":"Challenge: At-Most-K Window","idea":"Keep a frequency state and shrink while more than k distinct values are present.","complexity":"O(n) expected time · O(k) space","source":"fn longest_k_distinct(values: &[i32], k: usize) -> usize {\n    let mut counts = std::collections::HashMap::new();\n    let (mut left, mut best) = (0, 0);\n    for (right, &x) in values.iter().enumerate() {\n        *counts.entry(x).or_insert(0) += 1;\n        while counts.len() > k {\n            let old = values[left];\n            let count = counts.get_mut(&old).unwrap();\n            *count -= 1;\n            if *count == 0 {\n                counts.remove(&old);\n            }\n            left += 1;\n        }\n        best = best.max(right + 1 - left);\n    }\n    best\n}\n\nfn main() {\n    let result = longest_k_distinct(&[1, 2, 3], 2).to_string();\n    println!(\"{result}\");\n}\n","sites":[{"line":2,"function":"longest_k_distinct","statement":"let mut counts = std::collections::HashMap::new();"},{"line":3,"function":"longest_k_distinct","statement":"let (mut left, mut best) = (0, 0);"},{"line":4,"function":"longest_k_distinct","statement":"for (right, &x) in values.iter().enumerate() {"},{"line":5,"function":"longest_k_distinct","statement":"*counts.entry(x).or_insert(0) += 1;"},{"line":6,"function":"longest_k_distinct","statement":"while counts.len() > k {"},{"line":7,"function":"longest_k_distinct","statement":"let old = values[left];"},{"line":8,"function":"longest_k_distinct","statement":"let count = counts.get_mut(&old).unwrap();"},{"line":9,"function":"longest_k_distinct","statement":"*count -= 1;"},{"line":10,"function":"longest_k_distinct","statement":"if *count == 0 {"},{"line":11,"function":"longest_k_distinct","statement":"counts.remove(&old);"},{"line":12,"function":"longest_k_distinct","statement":"}"},{"line":13,"function":"longest_k_distinct","statement":"left += 1;"},{"line":14,"function":"longest_k_distinct","statement":"}"},{"line":15,"function":"longest_k_distinct","statement":"best = best.max(right + 1 - left);"},{"line":16,"function":"longest_k_distinct","statement":"}"},{"line":17,"function":"longest_k_distinct","statement":"best"},{"line":21,"function":"main","statement":"let result = longest_k_distinct(&[1, 2, 3], 2).to_string();"},{"line":22,"function":"main","statement":"println!(\"{result}\");"},{"line":23,"function":"main","statement":"}"}],"version":1,"input":"[1,2,3]","stdout":"2\n","values":[{"type":"&[i32]","data":{"kind":"list","items":[{"kind":"scalar","text":"1"},{"kind":"scalar","text":"2"},{"kind":"scalar","text":"3"}],"tuple":false}},{"type":"usize","data":{"kind":"scalar","text":"2"}},{"type":"std::collections::hash::map::HashMap<i32, i32>","data":{"kind":"map","entries":[]}},{"type":"usize","data":{"kind":"scalar","text":"0"}},{"type":"i32","data":{"kind":"scalar","text":"1"}},{"type":"std::collections::hash::map::HashMap<i32, i32>","data":{"kind":"map","entries":[[{"kind":"scalar","text":"1"},{"kind":"scalar","text":"1"}]]}},{"type":"usize","data":{"kind":"scalar","text":"1"}},{"type":"i32","data":{"kind":"scalar","text":"2"}},{"type":"std::collections::hash::map::HashMap<i32, i32>","data":{"kind":"map","entries":[[{"kind":"scalar","text":"1"},{"kind":"scalar","text":"1"}],[{"kind":"scalar","text":"2"},{"kind":"scalar","text":"1"}]]}},{"type":"i32","data":{"kind":"scalar","text":"3"}},{"type":"std::collections::hash::map::HashMap<i32, i32>","data":{"kind":"map","entries":[[{"kind":"scalar","text":"1"},{"kind":"scalar","text":"1"}],[{"kind":"scalar","text":"2"},{"kind":"scalar","text":"1"}],[{"kind":"scalar","text":"3"},{"kind":"scalar","text":"1"}]]}},{"type":"std::collections::hash::map::HashMap<i32, i32>","data":{"kind":"map","entries":[[{"kind":"scalar","text":"2"},{"kind":"scalar","text":"1"}],[{"kind":"scalar","text":"3"},{"k